  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「……はぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「だからさ〜、路銀が尽きたんだってば。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「振りこんでよ、貯めてたお金はすっからかんだし。知ってるでしょ、あたしの口座番号」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「たまにあたしの預金通帳、勝手に見てるの知ってるんだからね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「べつに怪しいバイトとかしてるわけじゃねぇわよ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「真っ当な手段で稼いだあたしのお金よ？　何に使おうと勝手でしょ、あんたたちに関係ないし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「はぁ？　どうして母親ぶってんの？　一人暮らしも反対だった？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「今さら！　あんたたちに迷惑はかけないから、心配するふりするのやめてよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ほんと『今さら』なのよ、だいたい親らしいことしてくれたことあった？　ないでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「戸籍上は娘であるあたしが世間さまに迷惑かけて、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「自分が後ろ指さされるのを嫌がってるだけでしょ？　あんたたちは！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「いいから金、振りこんでってば。べつにお金が惜しいならいいわよ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「稼ぐ方法なんていくらでもあるし。あんたたちに頼んだほうが早い、ってだけだし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あんたたちはお金しかくれなかった、お金が愛情ってことでしょ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「そのお金、ぜんぶ使いきったら帰国するわよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「それで永遠に『ばいばい』よ、縁切りってことでいいわよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「言っとくけどね、最初に縁切りしたのはあんたたちだから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あたしにはあんたたちの血が流れてる、遺伝子も受け継がれてる。でも、『それだけ』でしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あ〜、もう！　じゃあ、いいわよ！　この話はお終いね、ううん『何もかも』よ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あんたたちに電話したのが、『まちがい』だったわ！　じゃあねっ、パパとママだったひとたち！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「…………」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あ〜、腹立つ！　やっぱ電話するんじゃなかった、むかむかする！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（でもマジ、ど〜しよ……。ぜんぜん、まだ帰国したくないんだけどなぁ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（こっから日本までの直通便のチケット買えば、ほんとに無一文になっちゃう）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（親にたかれたら簡単だなぁと思ったけど、あのひとたち相変わらずだし……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（やっぱり、『他人』に頼ったのがまちがいよ。あたしの人生は、あたし自身の手で切り開く）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（そうよ。そのために、あたしは旅にでたのよ。あたし自身を、再発見するために。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（あたしの人生を再出発させるための、これは巡礼よ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（あたしは親に愛されなかった可哀想な子から、湖南やこに生まれ変わる。この旅で……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（ただの現実逃避、自分探しの旅、って世間のひとは笑うだろうけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（ハァ……。まじで、ど〜しよ。財布をすられちゃったのが痛かったなぁ、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（パスポートは無事だけど。念のために靴に隠してた、最低限の紙幣しかないわ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（ひとり旅だし、もっと気をつければよかった。なんて言っても、後の祭りね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（あたしも所詮は世間知らずな、ぬるま湯みたいなお嬢さま学校に首までつかったお子さまってこと？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（……ん？　あれっ、電話が鳴ってる？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「もしもしっ、何よ？　話はもう終わりよ、電話かけてこないでよ！」"
